Date: Tue, 27 Jan 2026 14:46:05 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 31/63] add back streamer and vhost_input_devices

Summary:
# Motivation:
We want to support webrtc on macos.

# Overview:
- add back streamer, vhost input device components

Test Plan:
# Build host tools on mac host
```
. build/envsetup.sh
lunch aosp_cf_arm64_phone-userdebug
m out/host/darwin-x86/cvd-host_package.tar.gz
```

# Launch:
```
# in device cache folder
ln -s /Volumes/AOSP/out/host/darwin-x86/cvd-host_package/* .
./start_cuttlefish.py
```

Rollback Plan:

